# Environment variables

Copy to `.env` locally. **Never commit `.env`.**

```bash
# Supabase (https://quvfkegqgbrvtmufndpn.supabase.co)
SUPABASE_URL=https://quvfkegqgbrvtmufndpn.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=          # server sync scripts, Streamlit backend only
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=                  # browser React UI (with RLS)

# React UI (Vite prefix)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://quvfkegqgbrvtmufndpn.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
VITE_USE_SAMPLE_DATA=false          # set true for offline UI dev

# Streamlit (.streamlit/secrets.toml — see streamlit/README after TASK-006)
# APP_PASSWORD=
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Orchestrator
CURSOR_API_KEY=
```

GitHub Actions secrets: `CURSOR_API_KEY`, `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` (for property sync workflow, TASK-007).
